(3152648, 440745, 48524, '<td valign="top">Nice and gritty.  I enjoy the tones a lot, and the scratches on the ground add to it.  Mmmm...grain.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and gritty.  I enjoy the tones a lot, and the scratches on the ground add to it.  Mmmm...grain.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-27 06:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152649, 442186, 48524, '<td valign="top">The colors are rather interesting, but I''m not a great fan of the composition.</td>', 'The colors are rather interesting, but I''m not a great fan of the composition.', '2006-12-27 06:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152651, 442609, 48524, '<td valign="top">An impressive collection  The DOF you used helps the image greatly, though I still feel like it lacks some interest.</td>', 'An impressive collection  The DOF you used helps the image greatly, though I still feel like it lacks some interest.', '2006-12-27 06:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152653, 442696, 48524, '<td valign="top">The white spot at the negative end of the battery is a bit distracting, but otherwise I kind of like it.  Slightly abstract, sharp, grainy.  None of which are bad things in my mind.</td>', 'The white spot at the negative end of the battery is a bit distracting, but otherwise I kind of like it.  Slightly abstract, sharp, grainy.  None of which are bad things in my mind.', '2006-12-27 06:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152655, 441942, 41206, '<td valign="top">We think alike!! I''m positive you deserve at least an 8</td>', 'We think alike!! I''m positive you deserve at least an 8', '2006-12-27 06:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152656, 441203, 48524, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see it a little brighter maybe?  And perhaps a slightly off-center composition as well.  Nice concept, though.  It has some good potential for visual appeal.</td>', 'I would have liked to see it a little brighter maybe?  And perhaps a slightly off-center composition as well.  Nice concept, though.  It has some good potential for visual appeal.', '2006-12-27 06:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152658, 441784, 41206, '<td valign="top">...mmm...nice! a 10 for lighting and creativity.</td>', '...mmm...nice! a 10 for lighting and creativity.', '2006-12-27 06:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152659, 442663, 48524, '<td valign="top">Focus is slightly off, and the cluttered objects don''t really help the image.  I think if you had just removed the objects on the left it would have improved the composition a bit.</td>', 'Focus is slightly off, and the cluttered objects don''t really help the image.  I think if you had just removed the objects on the left it would have improved the composition a bit.', '2006-12-27 06:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152660, 443009, 48524, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure the fisheye helps this image at all.  The one battery in the middle which is turned slightly is slightly interesting, but otherwise the bad focus and distortion just don''t work.</td>', 'Not quite sure the fisheye helps this image at all.  The one battery in the middle which is turned slightly is slightly interesting, but otherwise the bad focus and distortion just don''t work.', '2006-12-27 06:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152663, 441088, 48524, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup.  I like the slightly warm desaturation, and the cluster of batterites seems almost intimate.</td>', 'Nice closeup.  I like the slightly warm desaturation, and the cluster of batterites seems almost intimate.', '2006-12-27 06:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152664, 441175, 48524, '<td valign="top">Not quite making the connection between the title and the image.  You say they need to be recharged, but they look like they are wrapped up as a present, which means they should be fresh and ready to go?</td>', 'Not quite making the connection between the title and the image.  You say they need to be recharged, but they look like they are wrapped up as a present, which means they should be fresh and ready to go?', '2006-12-27 06:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152665, 441061, 41206, '<td valign="top">very creative!!!! a 10</td>', 'very creative!!!! a 10', '2006-12-27 06:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152667, 440900, 48524, '<td valign="top">Everything looks slightly tilted, which is a little disconcerting, i think.  Also, while the flashlight is clearly on, nothing seems to draw attention or focus to this fact, which I think would make the photo more interesting.</td>', 'Everything looks slightly tilted, which is a little disconcerting, i think.  Also, while the flashlight is clearly on, nothing seems to draw attention or focus to this fact, which I think would make the photo more interesting.', '2006-12-27 06:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152669, 441858, 48524, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it would have been improved with a different perspective.  Maybe from the front corner of the truck, so there is a sense of dynamic to the photo, instead of being shot straight on?</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it would have been improved with a different perspective.  Maybe from the front corner of the truck, so there is a sense of dynamic to the photo, instead of being shot straight on?', '2006-12-27 06:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152672, 442496, 48524, '<td valign="top">The grainy image turned me off at first, but was interesting enough for me to give it a second look.  I''ll say now that I don''t think it''s a bad thing, and a lot of little detail seems packed into this image.  I feel like it will be underrated in the challenge, though.  Good luck.</td>', 'The grainy image turned me off at first, but was interesting enough for me to give it a second look.  I''ll say now that I don''t think it''s a bad thing, and a lot of little detail seems packed into this image.  I feel like it will be underrated in the challenge, though.  Good luck.', '2006-12-27 06:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3152675, 442465, 48524, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous of your snow!  I wish we had some here.<br/> <br/>Interesting photo, shows much more creativity than the standard ''batteries standing on end'' shots all throughout the challenge.  Focus is slightly soft on the first battery, which will probably hurt you a little, but otherwise I think it''s a nice little image :)</td>', 'I''m jealous of your snow!  I wish we had some here. Interesting photo, shows much more creativity than the standard ''batteries standing on end'' shots all throughout the challenge.  Focus is slightly soft on the first battery, which will probably hurt you a little, but otherwise I think it''s a nice little image :)', '2006-12-27 06:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
