(3153585, 442465, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, isn''t this fun?  All of the elaborate setups we go thru just to get a photo.  He-he.  This one works pretty well.  Nice fade from front to back.  Subjects are well positioned overall.  Might have wanted to adjust the color temp a little to knock down some of the blue cast.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh, isn''t this fun?  All of the elaborate setups we go thru just to get a photo.  He-he.  This one works pretty well.  Nice fade from front to back.  Subjects are well positioned overall.  Might have wanted to adjust the color temp a little to knock down some of the blue cast.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-27 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
