(3153608, 442967, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever use of some wax and wick.  :D  Not sure, something seems a little off.  The bg being grey makes the image feel like it needs some contrast or levels adjustment.  The way the line (white on edge) on the battery lines up makes it look like a post-processing blunder (it probably wasn''t, just looks like it).  The "copper top" pattern gives the impression of the photo being noisy.  I know, many nitpiks - sorry, just trying to toss out some feedback on initial reaction to this photo.  It''s a neat concept.  Hope it does well for you - good luck.</td>', 'Clever use of some wax and wick.  :D  Not sure, something seems a little off.  The bg being grey makes the image feel like it needs some contrast or levels adjustment.  The way the line (white on edge) on the battery lines up makes it look like a post-processing blunder (it probably wasn''t, just looks like it).  The "copper top" pattern gives the impression of the photo being noisy.  I know, many nitpiks - sorry, just trying to toss out some feedback on initial reaction to this photo.  It''s a neat concept.  Hope it does well for you - good luck.', '2006-12-27 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
