(3154131, 442098, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow look at the composition... Love the rule of thirds here.  Why it''s in focus and CLEARLY is the MAIN FOCUS of the picture.  I like the lighting use to convey the loneliness of the one battery.  The color tone sets creates a nice mood.  Ever active and yet just sitting and waiting for action - nice juxtaposition.  And the title - what a hoot!  Um but how do I know that this really is an AA battery?  I just don''t SEE the AA... HA!  Just kidding.  Beautiful job!</td>', 'Wow look at the composition... Love the rule of thirds here.  Why it''s in focus and CLEARLY is the MAIN FOCUS of the picture.  I like the lighting use to convey the loneliness of the one battery.  The color tone sets creates a nice mood.  Ever active and yet just sitting and waiting for action - nice juxtaposition.  And the title - what a hoot!  Um but how do I know that this really is an AA battery?  I just don''t SEE the AA... HA!  Just kidding.  Beautiful job!', '2006-12-27 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
