(3155996, 442708, 68947, '<td valign="top">WOW, now this is a very artsy shot and title!  LOVE IT!  The focus on the salt and the background blurred battery are actually quite symbolic! Battery fades in the memory, but assault does not. Nice composition and the reflection on the salt piece really drives home the symbolism of this shot.  Assault is a reflection on the perpetrator and stays with them forever, but it also remains with the victim.  NICE, nice piece!  Nice commentary.  Clever thinking and photography through and through! 10 in my books!!!</td>', 'WOW, now this is a very artsy shot and title!  LOVE IT!  The focus on the salt and the background blurred battery are actually quite symbolic! Battery fades in the memory, but assault does not. Nice composition and the reflection on the salt piece really drives home the symbolism of this shot.  Assault is a reflection on the perpetrator and stays with them forever, but it also remains with the victim.  NICE, nice piece!  Nice commentary.  Clever thinking and photography through and through! 10 in my books!!!', '2006-12-28 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3155998, 442893, 68947, '<td valign="top">Looks like my nephew''s desk a couple of days after Christmas! *smile*  Nice shot.</td>', 'Looks like my nephew''s desk a couple of days after Christmas! *smile*  Nice shot.', '2006-12-28 11:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
