(3156163, 441100, 68011, '<td valign="top">nice title</td>', 'nice title', '2006-12-28 13:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156178, 442241, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun and clever.  Pushing the boundaries a bit with the extreme lower left positioning of the main subject.  I wonder if a lower angle would have allowed you to get pretty much the same effect but not have so much (basically) negative space?  The red is pixelating a little on this monitor, but this work PC isn''t the best.  Overall, I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is fun and clever.  Pushing the boundaries a bit with the extreme lower left positioning of the main subject.  I wonder if a lower angle would have allowed you to get pretty much the same effect but not have so much (basically) negative space?  The red is pixelating a little on this monitor, but this work PC isn''t the best.  Overall, I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-28 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156187, 441715, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something isn''t connecting for me with your message here.  I like the tones and the props used for this photo, but I don''t understand what those marks (beads, water, ???) are on the area in front of the battery, and how they contribute to the theme.  In making these comments I needed to scroll down to do so, and in doing so noticed that your photo may have been composed a little stronger in a landscape mode rather than portrait by cropping off a good portion of the upper part.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Something isn''t connecting for me with your message here.  I like the tones and the props used for this photo, but I don''t understand what those marks (beads, water, ???) are on the area in front of the battery, and how they contribute to the theme.  In making these comments I needed to scroll down to do so, and in doing so noticed that your photo may have been composed a little stronger in a landscape mode rather than portrait by cropping off a good portion of the upper part.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-28 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156192, 442253, 30049, '<td valign="top">DNMC, DNMC, DNMC!!!  That''s a AAA!  :D  Just pulling your leg.  Clever idea and I like the rotation on this.  The diagonal lines created this way work very well.  Nice even lighting.  Clean, crisp, and well focused.  You know what would have put this over the top?   A black background in the upper left instead of grey.  The border is a nice final touch to this.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'DNMC, DNMC, DNMC!!!  That''s a AAA!  :D  Just pulling your leg.  Clever idea and I like the rotation on this.  The diagonal lines created this way work very well.  Nice even lighting.  Clean, crisp, and well focused.  You know what would have put this over the top?   A black background in the upper left instead of grey.  The border is a nice final touch to this.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-28 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3156321, 442495, 46314, '<td valign="top">You need to work on your white balance...</td>', 'You need to work on your white balance...', '2006-12-28 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
