(3158366, 441784, 34217, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that this is the photo that started the whole nudity thead.  You know what, I did not know what this was at 11 and if the persons who kid say this does then they have bigger issues then complaining to you about the photo.  I love fine art nudes and not one person can say what is art and what is  not cause it is different for everyone.  Keep doing what you are doing and don''t worry about the people who get offended.  If they don''t like it then they can choose not to be apart of the site.<br/>As far as the photo goes, I think your light could have been more exciting, it is a little to straight on for my tastes.  I like dramitic light!</td>', 'I am assuming that this is the photo that started the whole nudity thead.  You know what, I did not know what this was at 11 and if the persons who kid say this does then they have bigger issues then complaining to you about the photo.  I love fine art nudes and not one person can say what is art and what is  not cause it is different for everyone.  Keep doing what you are doing and don''t worry about the people who get offended.  If they don''t like it then they can choose not to be apart of the site.As far as the photo goes, I think your light could have been more exciting, it is a little to straight on for my tastes.  I like dramitic light!', '2006-12-29 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158367, 442708, 34217, '<td valign="top">made me laugh</td>', 'made me laugh', '2006-12-29 01:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158400, 443010, 554, '<td valign="top">Bumping to a 10 even though I dislike the grey background and would have liked to have had brighter reds and blues.  Great idea and photo.</td>', 'Bumping to a 10 even though I dislike the grey background and would have liked to have had brighter reds and blues.  Great idea and photo.', '2006-12-29 02:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158429, 442284, 57570, '<td valign="top">some light on the batteries would have better</td>', 'some light on the batteries would have better', '2006-12-29 02:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
