(3158865, 442644, 65125, '<td valign="top">Nice gradient, maybe it would be better without the bright line on the bottom. I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice gradient, maybe it would be better without the bright line on the bottom. I like it nonetheless.', '2006-12-29 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158866, 441736, 65125, '<td valign="top">Good idea, i like it.</td>', 'Good idea, i like it.', '2006-12-29 08:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158867, 442416, 65125, '<td valign="top">Funny photo.</td>', 'Funny photo.', '2006-12-29 08:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158952, 441440, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute and daring.  Toy shots are risky if you are concerned about your score.  That being said, I think you did a nice job with this overall.  One thing that is distracting is the blue cast.  An adjustment to color temp would take care of this for you - or - setting black/white points can straighten it out as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute and daring.  Toy shots are risky if you are concerned about your score.  That being said, I think you did a nice job with this overall.  One thing that is distracting is the blue cast.  An adjustment to color temp would take care of this for you - or - setting black/white points can straighten it out as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 09:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158954, 442687, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  A little over the top on processing for my taste.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  A little over the top on processing for my taste.  Good luck.', '2006-12-29 09:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3158962, 442893, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute title!  Gives this pile of batteries a whole new perspective.  :D  I don''t know what it is that you used as the background, but I like the color for this (bronze).  The dust specks in the upper right are a minor distraction.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute title!  Gives this pile of batteries a whole new perspective.  :D  I don''t know what it is that you used as the background, but I like the color for this (bronze).  The dust specks in the upper right are a minor distraction.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 09:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159134, 442495, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever title and take on the challenge theme.  Couple of things that are holding this photo back on scoring.  Color temp is way off - if you adjust your white balance this would look white instead of yellow.  Line in the background where your backgrounds meet shouldn''t be visible.  Diffuse your lighting some to eliminate the harsh glare that you''ve gotten on the back side of the saucer.  The positioning of your subject is good as is the focus.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever title and take on the challenge theme.  Couple of things that are holding this photo back on scoring.  Color temp is way off - if you adjust your white balance this would look white instead of yellow.  Line in the background where your backgrounds meet shouldn''t be visible.  Diffuse your lighting some to eliminate the harsh glare that you''ve gotten on the back side of the saucer.  The positioning of your subject is good as is the focus.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 10:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159145, 442098, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple idea - which is fine.  Image is too noisy/grainy for a studio setup shot.  Did you crop this in from a larger photo?  If yes, try and get closer and fill the frame initially as that will reduce noise.  Did you underexpose and bring back the details in post-processing?  If yes, try and expose/light the subject a little better initially instead of attempting to recover in post-processing.  Also, check your ISO setting.  Use the lowest ISO your camera allows for shots like this.  All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck.</td>', 'Clean, simple idea - which is fine.  Image is too noisy/grainy for a studio setup shot.  Did you crop this in from a larger photo?  If yes, try and get closer and fill the frame initially as that will reduce noise.  Did you underexpose and bring back the details in post-processing?  If yes, try and expose/light the subject a little better initially instead of attempting to recover in post-processing.  Also, check your ISO setting.  Use the lowest ISO your camera allows for shots like this.  All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck.', '2006-12-29 10:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159192, 442713, 66497, '<td valign="top">very clever idea... a little dark though</td>', 'very clever idea... a little dark though', '2006-12-29 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159194, 443010, 66497, '<td valign="top">it would be cool to have the duracell batter.... almost as though the duracel battery knocked out the energizer bunny!</td>', 'it would be cool to have the duracell batter.... almost as though the duracel battery knocked out the energizer bunny!', '2006-12-29 10:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159200, 442113, 66497, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2006-12-29 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159233, 443021, 16402, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that I''m that "wowwed" by the concept, but I do like the lighting.</td>', 'Don''t know that I''m that "wowwed" by the concept, but I do like the lighting.', '2006-12-29 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159234, 442113, 16402, '<td valign="top">Extra point for being hilarious! 6</td>', 'Extra point for being hilarious! 6', '2006-12-29 11:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159238, 440806, 16402, '<td valign="top">Not very compelling, sorry.</td>', 'Not very compelling, sorry.', '2006-12-29 11:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159240, 442098, 16402, '<td valign="top">Little bit too much negative space IMHO, but nice lighting and color.</td>', 'Little bit too much negative space IMHO, but nice lighting and color.', '2006-12-29 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159257, 442984, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image.  At first I thought it was just a bunch of batteries kind of stacked up.  Then I read your title.  Looked again and saw "Mr. Coppertop".  He gets lost with the higher stack off to the side behind him.  :(  Clever idea.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice crisp image.  At first I thought it was just a bunch of batteries kind of stacked up.  Then I read your title.  Looked again and saw "Mr. Coppertop".  He gets lost with the higher stack off to the side behind him.  :(  Clever idea.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 11:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159263, 442708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now if you just had a tiny little key to put on that salt...  :D  This is well done and a neat idea.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Now if you just had a tiny little key to put on that salt...  :D  This is well done and a neat idea.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159268, 441752, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, but it didn''t quite work out this time.  The lighting on the battery isn''t strong enough and there is quite a bit of noise in this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fun idea, but it didn''t quite work out this time.  The lighting on the battery isn''t strong enough and there is quite a bit of noise in this.  Good luck.', '2006-12-29 11:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159286, 442991, 16402, '<td valign="top">Really cool abstract concept and execution.</td>', 'Really cool abstract concept and execution.', '2006-12-29 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159290, 442654, 16402, '<td valign="top">Not very compelling, IMHO.</td>', 'Not very compelling, IMHO.', '2006-12-29 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159292, 440769, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice color.</td>', 'Lots of nice color.', '2006-12-29 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159294, 442998, 16402, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s kinda nasty! And should those really be C batteries?</td>', 'Hey, that''s kinda nasty! And should those really be C batteries?', '2006-12-29 11:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159296, 442707, 16402, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off -- makes it look to me like it''s falling rather than floating.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off -- makes it look to me like it''s falling rather than floating.', '2006-12-29 11:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159299, 442963, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2006-12-29 11:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159300, 442644, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is the 2nd to last photo of the whole challenge that I''ve seen now, so I can say accurately -- this one''s the best and should win the blue ribbon :)   Way to go taking the boredom out of a battery photo.  This is awesome!  10</td>', 'This is the 2nd to last photo of the whole challenge that I''ve seen now, so I can say accurately -- this one''s the best and should win the blue ribbon :)   Way to go taking the boredom out of a battery photo.  This is awesome!  10', '2006-12-29 11:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159301, 442182, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very graphic.</td>', 'Very graphic.', '2006-12-29 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159310, 442976, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this!   I love the 3-d effect created by your depth of field.  Verywell done!</td>', 'I like this!   I love the 3-d effect created by your depth of field.  Verywell done!', '2006-12-29 11:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159316, 442496, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the slight grain to this.   It has that interesting grungy effect -- making even batteries look cool :)</td>', 'I love the slight grain to this.   It has that interesting grungy effect -- making even batteries look cool :)', '2006-12-29 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3159324, 442945, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok. . I''ve seen 2 now that ought to be ribbon winners. . .hope this one is clearly in the running!   Awesome photo!  10</td>', 'Ok. . I''ve seen 2 now that ought to be ribbon winners. . .hope this one is clearly in the running!   Awesome photo!  10', '2006-12-29 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
