(3159794, 442275, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever concept.  Based on the way you''ve put this together (text orientation on the batteries and left/right positions) it looks like the ''Energizer'' batteries are chasing the ''Duracell'' ones.  Hard to tell if that was your intention or not.  The lighting is a little harsh, try using a diffuser on your lights if you can (white tissue paper or a thin sheet, or direct the light at a whiteboard where the light bounces back at the subject).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever concept.  Based on the way you''ve put this together (text orientation on the batteries and left/right positions) it looks like the ''Energizer'' batteries are chasing the ''Duracell'' ones.  Hard to tell if that was your intention or not.  The lighting is a little harsh, try using a diffuser on your lights if you can (white tissue paper or a thin sheet, or direct the light at a whiteboard where the light bounces back at the subject). Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-29 14:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
