(3163378, 441061, 30049, '<td valign="top">Creative.  I like your use of lighting in that it creates a natural vignetting.  I imagine you needed it (lighting) this way for the extreme shadows that make this photo what it is, but still a nice side effect.  :D  The title is throwing me off a bit.  I understand the twin towers of the WTC connection, but how are they still strong? They don''t exist anymore except in our hearts, minds, and memories.  Having said all that, I don''t have any suggestions for a better title...hmmm.<br/> <br/>Anyway, a nice creative shot, with an emotive twist to it.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Creative.  I like your use of lighting in that it creates a natural vignetting.  I imagine you needed it (lighting) this way for the extreme shadows that make this photo what it is, but still a nice side effect.  :D  The title is throwing me off a bit.  I understand the twin towers of the WTC connection, but how are they still strong? They don''t exist anymore except in our hearts, minds, and memories.  Having said all that, I don''t have any suggestions for a better title...hmmm. Anyway, a nice creative shot, with an emotive twist to it.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-30 22:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
