(3163396, 441091, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Almost forgot for a minute that this is a AA Battery challenge when I was thinking about your setup for this.  For the life of me I couldn''t figure out what kind of pushpins you used.  :D  Couple of things that would make this stronger for me.  The lighting, if more uniform across "LIFE", would be better IMO.  The "stars" could stand to be more like pinpoints and lose the slight blur.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Almost forgot for a minute that this is a AA Battery challenge when I was thinking about your setup for this.  For the life of me I couldn''t figure out what kind of pushpins you used.  :D  Couple of things that would make this stronger for me.  The lighting, if more uniform across "LIFE", would be better IMO.  The "stars" could stand to be more like pinpoints and lose the slight blur.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-30 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
