(3167994, 442987, 37053, '<td valign="top">I like the concept ok but I''m not crazy about the angle or the shallow depth of field.<br/> <br/>Edit:  I''m adding to this because apparently you didn''t find this comment helpful.  It seems you didn''t find any comments that weren''t glowing helpful.<br/> <br/>I didn''t like this shot and was one of the 31 people that rated it a 4.  You could have scored higher if it you had more depth of field - the bottom left battery in particular is distracting and takes away from the subject.  Also the camera doesn''t appear to have been very straight which makes the composition seem sloppy, a lower angle would have made the viewer feel more like they were a part of the shot an would have improved it drastically.<br/> <br/>This comment and the original was written to <u>help</u> you do better in future challenges.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-09 03:40:24.</i></td>', 'I like the concept ok but I''m not crazy about the angle or the shallow depth of field. Edit:  I''m adding to this because apparently you didn''t find this comment helpful.  It seems you didn''t find any comments that weren''t glowing helpful. I didn''t like this shot and was one of the 31 people that rated it a 4.  You could have scored higher if it you had more depth of field - the bottom left battery in particular is distracting and takes away from the subject.  Also the camera doesn''t appear to have been very straight which makes the composition seem sloppy, a lower angle would have made the viewer feel more like they were a part of the shot an would have improved it drastically. This comment and the original was written to help you do better in future challenges.', '2007-01-01 18:38:28.000000', '2007-01-09 03:40:24.000000', 1),
