(3171068, 442573, 70883, '<td valign="top">A nice composition and lighting idea. It really makes me want to take a second look. However, once we see what it is, we loose a bit of interest; it''s one of those head scratcher things right? Maybe further drama could have been added with shallow depth, so that we only see the form of those rods.</td>', 'A nice composition and lighting idea. It really makes me want to take a second look. However, once we see what it is, we loose a bit of interest; it''s one of those head scratcher things right? Maybe further drama could have been added with shallow depth, so that we only see the form of those rods.', '2007-01-02 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
