(3171125, 441658, 70883, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it looks like this might be for a craft contest, not a photo contest. Ask yourself, what is it about the way I will take this picture that will tell people I am a talented photographer?</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it looks like this might be for a craft contest, not a photo contest. Ask yourself, what is it about the way I will take this picture that will tell people I am a talented photographer?', '2007-01-02 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171132, 442515, 70883, '<td valign="top">I like how this picture makes me ask, "how was it done?" Nice idea and execution.</td>', 'I like how this picture makes me ask, "how was it done?" Nice idea and execution.', '2007-01-02 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171144, 442439, 70883, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution, but I just don''t believe it. It needs something more. I think it has something to do with it looking a little off-balance.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution, but I just don''t believe it. It needs something more. I think it has something to do with it looking a little off-balance.', '2007-01-02 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171158, 441715, 70883, '<td valign="top">Nice setting and lighting, I like that I have no idea where this was taken, but the imprinted words on the surface tell us this is an industrial environment. It just needs more content; too much negative space there. It''s the beginning to something really cool.</td>', 'Nice setting and lighting, I like that I have no idea where this was taken, but the imprinted words on the surface tell us this is an industrial environment. It just needs more content; too much negative space there. It''s the beginning to something really cool.', '2007-01-02 14:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171176, 442899, 70883, '<td valign="top">The execution is really nice! I just have no idea why a battery would be in this setting. If there was an underwater electronic product somewhere in the background, that would make this a potential 10 in my eyes.</td>', 'The execution is really nice! I just have no idea why a battery would be in this setting. If there was an underwater electronic product somewhere in the background, that would make this a potential 10 in my eyes.', '2007-01-02 14:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171188, 442811, 70883, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the title and good execution, but I just don''t think the picture stands on its own. I''d like to be able to know why this battery is where it is without a title.</td>', 'Nice idea with the title and good execution, but I just don''t think the picture stands on its own. I''d like to be able to know why this battery is where it is without a title.', '2007-01-02 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171191, 442730, 70883, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I think the colors could have been adjusted and the focus could have been more effectively placed. What are you emphasizing? The side of the battery or its contacts?</td>', 'Nice composition, but I think the colors could have been adjusted and the focus could have been more effectively placed. What are you emphasizing? The side of the battery or its contacts?', '2007-01-02 15:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171205, 442596, 64733, '<td valign="top">doesn''t seem in focus to me.</td>', 'doesn''t seem in focus to me.', '2007-01-02 15:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171210, 442750, 70883, '<td valign="top">If this is a real "dilemma", I just don''t see this scene happening as perfectly as it is; on this white backdrop. For this to have more impact, I''d imagine seeing a person''s face in the background, and all these things on the person''s bed perhaps; show us why you trust these batteries to get you out of this dilemma.</td>', 'If this is a real "dilemma", I just don''t see this scene happening as perfectly as it is; on this white backdrop. For this to have more impact, I''d imagine seeing a person''s face in the background, and all these things on the person''s bed perhaps; show us why you trust these batteries to get you out of this dilemma.', '2007-01-02 15:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171222, 440993, 70883, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition, but I just can''t see why it''s worthwhile to look at this picture. Are energizer''s better or worse than duracell and how does this justify this separation?</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition, but I just can''t see why it''s worthwhile to look at this picture. Are energizer''s better or worse than duracell and how does this justify this separation?', '2007-01-02 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171226, 442967, 70883, '<td valign="top">What hurts this picture for me is that I can immediately see how it was done. If you could somehow hide your method and still get some good flames, that would really be awesome. Better image quality couldn''t hurt either. Do all you can with your camera so you don''t have to over-sharpen or crop in too much.</td>', 'What hurts this picture for me is that I can immediately see how it was done. If you could somehow hide your method and still get some good flames, that would really be awesome. Better image quality couldn''t hurt either. Do all you can with your camera so you don''t have to over-sharpen or crop in too much.', '2007-01-02 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171235, 442448, 70883, '<td valign="top">For what it is, it''s great. I love how this photo doesn''t need to show the name "duracell" or "energizer," like the other entries have done. Simpler is usually better if it''s done well, and it''s done well here. The title also hints to us that this person is just starting to recycle.</td>', 'For what it is, it''s great. I love how this photo doesn''t need to show the name "duracell" or "energizer," like the other entries have done. Simpler is usually better if it''s done well, and it''s done well here. The title also hints to us that this person is just starting to recycle.', '2007-01-02 15:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171239, 442976, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice perspective</td>', 'nice perspective', '2007-01-02 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171240, 441625, 70883, '<td valign="top">You''ve used the most basic ability of the camera to your advantage here, and it''s great. I''ve seldom seen deliberate overexposure work this good. Nice job. I''d just like to see better image quality and maybe better color.</td>', 'You''ve used the most basic ability of the camera to your advantage here, and it''s great. I''ve seldom seen deliberate overexposure work this good. Nice job. I''d just like to see better image quality and maybe better color.', '2007-01-02 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171246, 441061, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice tribute to the twin towers, good clear labeling of Battery Park to reinforce fitting it all together.  Effective lighting, well done.</td>', 'Great idea and nice tribute to the twin towers, good clear labeling of Battery Park to reinforce fitting it all together.  Effective lighting, well done.', '2007-01-02 15:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
