(3171260, 442545, 70883, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome. I don''t know why batteries would be ghosts, but it''s great to look at. The only thing that kills it for me is that it''s on a wood surface. It makes me think that you''ve done this on your coffee table or something. Maybe a better surface would work for you here.</td>', 'This is just awesome. I don''t know why batteries would be ghosts, but it''s great to look at. The only thing that kills it for me is that it''s on a wood surface. It makes me think that you''ve done this on your coffee table or something. Maybe a better surface would work for you here.', '2007-01-02 15:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
