(3171275, 441091, 70883, '<td valign="top">Its cool how you''ve use the subject of the battery in a very non-traditional way. We can''t tell that they''re batteries, and that''s actually a good thing here. However, it just doesn''t make visual sense. Nothing is actually ON the planet in this picture, and it stumps me as to why a big L-I-F-E would be in space.</td>', 'Its cool how you''ve use the subject of the battery in a very non-traditional way. We can''t tell that they''re batteries, and that''s actually a good thing here. However, it just doesn''t make visual sense. Nothing is actually ON the planet in this picture, and it stumps me as to why a big L-I-F-E would be in space.', '2007-01-02 15:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171276, 442416, 44490, '<td valign="top">Love the expression, eyes, hands, hair, smoke - fun and powerful!</td>', 'Love the expression, eyes, hands, hair, smoke - fun and powerful!', '2007-01-02 15:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
