(3171405, 442998, 30049, '<td valign="top">If your remote control goes thru that many batteries it may time to consider an upgrade.  :D  The blue tone is an interesting twist.  Works well overall, but does seem a bit odd on the hand.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If your remote control goes thru that many batteries it may time to consider an upgrade.  :D  The blue tone is an interesting twist.  Works well overall, but does seem a bit odd on the hand.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-02 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
