(3173125, 441625, 12200, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m pleased to see that the vast majority of the votes on this one were 5''s--right smack dab in the middle. I knew the subject of this shot was probably going to be difficult to sell, and I think I''ve learned a lot from the commentators. The shot is clearly overexposed--beyond effectiveness, I think--and its a little blurry. I sincerely appreciate everyone''s opinions, and we''ll keep on pluggin''. Practice is what this is all about for me...learn what works and what doesn''t.<br/> <br/>Personally, I''m bustin'' about just breaking the 5.0 mark with this one.</td>', 'Well, I''m pleased to see that the vast majority of the votes on this one were 5''s--right smack dab in the middle. I knew the subject of this shot was probably going to be difficult to sell, and I think I''ve learned a lot from the commentators. The shot is clearly overexposed--beyond effectiveness, I think--and its a little blurry. I sincerely appreciate everyone''s opinions, and we''ll keep on pluggin''. Practice is what this is all about for me...learn what works and what doesn''t. Personally, I''m bustin'' about just breaking the 5.0 mark with this one.', '2007-01-03 00:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
