(3174388, 443011, 60614, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 11th place.  I didn''t get a chance to vote but I would have scored it high if I did.  I love the blue fiber-optic light.  Good idea to put them in a arch and then rotate the photo later.  Gave it a great effect.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 11th place.  I didn''t get a chance to vote but I would have scored it high if I did.  I love the blue fiber-optic light.  Good idea to put them in a arch and then rotate the photo later.  Gave it a great effect.', '2007-01-03 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
