(3174981, 441784, 47534, '<td valign="top">Bravo!<br/> <br/>I get so sick and tired of hearing/seeing comments like ''family site''.... wtfe!  Forget the prudes, label it adult &amp; let the rest learn how to monitor their children''s internet activity.  Plenty of us do NOT have a problem with the content, so please continue to entertain!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a colorful capture with good details - and a pretty good job overall, given the Basic Editing.  Plus, it already sounds as though you''ve learned something about lighting, and THAT seems to be the entire point of DPC (to challenge yourself, as well as others).</td>', 'Bravo! I get so sick and tired of hearing/seeing comments like ''family site''.... wtfe!  Forget the prudes, label it adult & let the rest learn how to monitor their children''s internet activity.  Plenty of us do NOT have a problem with the content, so please continue to entertain! Congratulations on a colorful capture with good details - and a pretty good job overall, given the Basic Editing.  Plus, it already sounds as though you''ve learned something about lighting, and THAT seems to be the entire point of DPC (to challenge yourself, as well as others).', '2007-01-03 10:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
