(3176425, 442755, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and size comparison, but I think the idea is too random for voters. Also, you can''t really see all of the toy because the bottom is cropped off.</td>', 'I like the perspective and size comparison, but I think the idea is too random for voters. Also, you can''t really see all of the toy because the bottom is cropped off.', '2007-01-03 15:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176448, 442636, 52130, '<td valign="top">Photographically speaking, I don''t think this is a particularly bad. The lighting on the ''chest'' and batteries is very good, however the left shoulder and the face is blacked out from the shadow, which people might have dinged you on. The color temp is a little too warm, but I appreciate the lack of noise and the idea, even though it might be controversial to some.</td>', 'Photographically speaking, I don''t think this is a particularly bad. The lighting on the ''chest'' and batteries is very good, however the left shoulder and the face is blacked out from the shadow, which people might have dinged you on. The color temp is a little too warm, but I appreciate the lack of noise and the idea, even though it might be controversial to some.', '2007-01-03 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176453, 442696, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like the background, but it''s either too grainy or not grainy enough, I''m not sure. The lighting is blown out a bit on the actual battery is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I like the background, but it''s either too grainy or not grainy enough, I''m not sure. The lighting is blown out a bit on the actual battery is somewhat distracting.', '2007-01-03 15:16:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3176459, 442336, 52130, '<td valign="top">Although it''s random, I like the idea. I think the lighting is verynice on the batteries, but there seem to be a lot of shadows in the background. Maybe a clean white background would have looked better and more commercial-like.</td>', 'Although it''s random, I like the idea. I think the lighting is verynice on the batteries, but there seem to be a lot of shadows in the background. Maybe a clean white background would have looked better and more commercial-like.', '2007-01-03 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
