(3176793, 442495, 70056, '<td valign="top">To all people who didn''t get it, and are looking for some sort of explanation... It''s a pun on "assault and battery." My original idea was throwing a battery at a box of salt, but those didn''t turn out as well. And yes, I looking back on it, I should have changed the white balance... it was a lack of judgement on my part, as I thought the yellow brought the battery out more. Now that I look at it however, definitely not.</td>', 'To all people who didn''t get it, and are looking for some sort of explanation... It''s a pun on "assault and battery." My original idea was throwing a battery at a box of salt, but those didn''t turn out as well. And yes, I looking back on it, I should have changed the white balance... it was a lack of judgement on my part, as I thought the yellow brought the battery out more. Now that I look at it however, definitely not.', '2007-01-03 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
