(3176856, 442495, 19708, '<td valign="top">A real quick and easy white balance is as easy as:<br/>Image, Adjustments, Match Color, click the Neutralize box and watch what happens. (Photoshop)<br/>Minor Color Intensity and/or Luminance slider adjustments can be done on some pics, but this one was basically correct with the Neutralize box checked. It''s that easy.</td>', 'A real quick and easy white balance is as easy as:Image, Adjustments, Match Color, click the Neutralize box and watch what happens. (Photoshop)Minor Color Intensity and/or Luminance slider adjustments can be done on some pics, but this one was basically correct with the Neutralize box checked. It''s that easy.', '2007-01-03 16:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
