(3178637, 442755, 66384, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. OOBIE worthy! I think the other commenters have done a good job of figuring out how to improve the shot, and why it didn''t score well. Focus always has a lot to do with the score. I''m still struggling with this ''too busy'' thing in my own photos. I have yet to understand when or why something is too busy. I think the thing that is the most distracting here is the crop at the bottom that nicks off the bottom of  the primary object.</td>', 'Excellent idea. OOBIE worthy! I think the other commenters have done a good job of figuring out how to improve the shot, and why it didn''t score well. Focus always has a lot to do with the score. I''m still struggling with this ''too busy'' thing in my own photos. I have yet to understand when or why something is too busy. I think the thing that is the most distracting here is the crop at the bottom that nicks off the bottom of  the primary object.', '2007-01-03 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
