(3184771, 442098, 64733, '<td valign="top">i agree with some of the comments.  it''s shot well, but lacks "umph!"  the image does seem noisy, not sure what caused it.<br/> <br/>from an abstract perspective, the ground plane looks like it''s moving, which makes it interesting.  i think that''s a by-product of the simplicity of the subject and the placement within the frame.</td>', 'i agree with some of the comments.  it''s shot well, but lacks "umph!"  the image does seem noisy, not sure what caused it. from an abstract perspective, the ground plane looks like it''s moving, which makes it interesting.  i think that''s a by-product of the simplicity of the subject and the placement within the frame.', '2007-01-05 12:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
